{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act14side_level_act14side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act14side",
  "stageId": "act14side_03",
  "title": "人心難測",
  "storyCode": "BI-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9a287f8f216a51b73e649cfd8adedf6ce533538c7514039f6ca732ea38375ebb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "彙報情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情況不太對，博士猜得沒錯，這邊聚集了很多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們是向著工廠那邊進發的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是......我確定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想辦法跟上，隨時報告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "收到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼這所工廠的交接也完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "目前為止都進行得很順利，多虧了博士您的調停。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前可能有點怠慢了，真是不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別在意，我只是個學者。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哎呀，您可別這麼謙虛，以後還有很多事情需要請教您。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瓦萊絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "且慢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呃，瓦萊絲將軍是對此有什麼疑問嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瓦萊絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "有埋伏。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不愧是瓦萊絲將軍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瓦萊絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "什麼人？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "來討說法的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "諸位，魏斯和博士方才應該已經向領民代表們傳達過喀蘭貿易的措施了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我想，其中一定是有什麼誤會......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "誤會？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "切斯特先生，你恐怕還不明白。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "恩希歐迪斯老爺被這個外國人騙了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你說什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們原先也都被蒙在鼓裡，直到有人告訴了我們才明白過來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "切斯特先生應該知道，原本這個外國人來謝拉格的名頭，是要擔任礦石病和感染者處理方式的顧問。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瓦萊絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_261_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你什麼意思？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "線人的情報不會錯的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這個外國人已經和阿克托斯達成了合作，而瓦萊絲將軍則是負責監視他的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "誰不知道，蔓珠院和阿克托斯早已不滿恩希歐迪斯老爺對謝拉格的開拓。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這個外國人，會以工廠會傳播礦石病為理由，大量提供對老爺不利的證據，永久關閉工廠！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瓦萊絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這是污蔑！佩爾羅契家何曾做過這等見不得光的事！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "佩爾羅契家與蔓珠院互相勾結，見不得光的事和犧牲的人還少嗎？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瓦萊絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_261_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瓦萊絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_261_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "父親，父親！你還好嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大長老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "來，喝了它吧，喝下去就好了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大長老",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "耶拉岡德的眼淚會洗淨山雪鬼留下的邪毒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瓦萊絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......你有什麼證據！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我呸，你們自己幹的破事，還要來問我？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，這......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不是真的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "切斯特",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_267_1#2$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "......我可以相信嗎？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "怎麼，說不出話了？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你覺得呢？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "少在這裡油嘴滑舌的！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不必多說了，我要你給我們一個交代！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瓦萊絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_261_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "衛兵！保護客人！把他們拿下！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "先抓住那個外國人！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "武裝的領民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你、你從哪冒出來的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這裡不安全！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "該跑了博士！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "烏薩斯幹員將你扛在了肩膀上，大步向樹林裡衝去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "啊，不用跑了，放我下來吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啊！好的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唉......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我必須跟你重申一下，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不管你有什麼樣的計畫，這都太冒險了。這話你可能不記得了，但我以前就跟你說過很多很多次。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我還是很相信你的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "任何人都會失手，就算是我也一樣。如果可以的話我希望你能降低我的工作難度。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "雖然可能性不高，但是萬一那些襲擊者中混入了更加專業的戰鬥人員怎麼辦？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果他們帶了弩箭，又怎麼辦？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別擔心，他們的目的不在於殺我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我向博士彙報一下情況。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Sharp隊長與我各自遵照博士托人帶來的口信，分別去布朗陶家的宅邸和希瓦艾什家的工廠追蹤可疑人員。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "結果我們的線索最後竟然連到了一起......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這些人很可能是被布朗陶家煽動的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "煽動普通人，敗壞對手的名聲，很常見的計謀，但是很粗糙。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "看似為了挑起我與希瓦艾什家的矛盾。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "看似為了挑起佩爾羅契家與希瓦艾什家的矛盾。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但也可能是個陷阱。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士的意思是......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這些人的裝備和戰力都不怎麼樣，甚至不足以全身而退。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一旦他們被捕再經審問，供出他們獲取消息的來源......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerToken": "avg_422_aurora_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可能反而會對布朗陶家不利？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "也不儘然。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們的情報不足，尚不能見事件的全貌，無法真正鎖定幕後的主使與其目的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_252",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "現在唯一能確定的是有人想挑撥三家間的關係，換言之就是要破壞雪境的整體穩定，形勢對作為外人的博士你來說非常危險。"
